{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026G2KpmpRjrF1793585643.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>人民幣中間價終止連續3天的升勢。</p><p></p><p>官方開出的人民幣中間價，報6.7146，較上個交易日下調8點子。現貨人民幣方面，在岸價和離岸價，早段於6.65水平上落。另外人民銀行開展5,410億元人民幣隔夜逆回購操作，扣除今日到期的逆回購，單日在市場淨回籠5,150億元人民幣。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:00:03.709203+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-02T02:13:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-03T00:58:42.733646+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T02:58:12.499063+00:00","content_hash":"4028beeb0e45584a1c6a4950a2ad5371dcd14c3c0dc8e9aca2aa6b0299f529f6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-02T03:00:03.709203+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}